            <ArticleTitle>Reflective practice in health care and how to reflect effectively.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/IJ9.0000000000000020</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Reflective practice is a paper requirement of your career progression in health care. However, if done properly, it can greatly improve your skills as a health care provider. This article provides some structure to reflective practice to allow a health care provider to engage more with reflective practice and get more out of the experience.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
